// Tern Compact body: an early-2000s compact four-door sedan.
//
// Intent: small, neat and tall for its size. A short rounded nose with swept lamps and a
// small bright grille, a raked windshield into an arched roof, a short high deck, a soft
// rising beltline, wrapped tail lamps, body-colored bumpers and plastic wheel covers on
// most of them. Mostly silver. Generic period cues only.
//
// Units are meters; x runs rearward from the nose, y up from the ground. Layout:
// docs/VEHICLES.md and crates/vehicle/src/shape/params.rs.
